the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base frequency includes these resources:
    lomo.

the knowledge base frequency includes:

the text of the source description is at "sources/frequency.ttl".

% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.

the values of "lomo:instant" have the datatype "xsd:gYear".


item a 1 is identified by "http://example.org/A1".

item a 1 is an action.

item a 1 has the time specification item a 1 time.


item a 1 time is a temporal specification.

item a 1 time has the frequency "P1Y".

item a 1 time is finished by item a 1 time end time.


item a 1 time end time is a temporal specification.

item a 1 time end time has the instant "2035".


% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
scenario from_30_june_2030 is, as stated in the source description:
    the calendar starts on 2030-06-30.
    falls_2030_to_2040 expects answers ["item a 1 time falls on 2031-06-30 in the period from 2030-01-01 to 2040-12-31", "item a 1 time falls on 2032-06-30 in the period from 2030-01-01 to 2040-12-31", "item a 1 time falls on 2033-06-30 in the period from 2030-01-01 to 2040-12-31", "item a 1 time falls on 2034-06-30 in the period from 2030-01-01 to 2040-12-31", "item a 1 time falls on 2035-06-30 in the period from 2030-01-01 to 2040-12-31"].
    first_dates expects answers ["the first date of item a 1 time end time is 2035-01-01"].
    last_dates expects answers ["the last date of item a 1 time end time is 2035-12-31"].

query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query instants is:
    which temporal specification has the instant which date.

query frequencies is:
    which temporal specification has the frequency which duration.

query first_dates is:
    the first date of which temporal specification is which date.

query last_dates is:
    the last date of which temporal specification is which date.

query later_times is:
    which temporal specification is later than which second temporal specification.

query times_within is:
    which temporal specification is during which second temporal specification.

query broken_links is:
    which temporal specification breaks its link with which second temporal specification.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

query literal_forms is:
    the values of which property have the datatype which datatype.

query falls_2030_to_2040 is:
    which temporal specification falls on which date in the period from 2030-01-01 to 2040-12-31.

